# Third-party agent content, kept local rather than redistributed through this
# repo. `npx skills add` writes .agents/skills/ plus skills-lock.json; the
# 10xDevs CLI (`10x get` / `10x sync`) writes paid course material into
# .claude/skills/, .claude/prompts/ and .claude/config-templates/. Ignoring
# .claude/ wholesale also covers artifact types future lessons may introduce.
.agents/
.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
skills-lock.json
